{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1954","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Colored Balls"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are balls of $$$n$$$ different colors; the number of balls of the $$$i$$$-th color is $$$a_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The balls can be combined into groups. Each group should contain at most $$$2$$$ balls, and no more than $$$1$$$ ball of each color."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider all $$$2^n$$$ sets of colors. For a set of colors, let's denote its "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"value"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" as the minimum number of groups the balls of those colors can be distributed into. For example, if there are three colors with $$$3$$$, $$$1$$$ and $$$7$$$ balls respectively, they can be combined into $$$7$$$ groups (and not less than $$$7$$$), so the value of that set of colors is $$$7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to calculate the sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"values"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" over all $$$2^n$$$ possible sets of colors. Since the answer may be too large, print it modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 5000$$$) — the number of colors."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 5000$$$) — the number of balls of the $$$i$$$-th color."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additional constraint on input: the total number of balls doesn't exceed $$$5000$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the sum of values of all $$$2^n$$$ sets of colors, taken modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n1 1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n11\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1 3 3 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n76\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider the first example. There are $$$8$$$ sets of colors:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the empty set, its value is $$$0$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the set $$$\\{1\\}$$$, its value is $$$1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the set $$$\\{2\\}$$$, its value is $$$1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the set $$$\\{3\\}$$$, its value is $$$2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the set $$$\\{1,2\\}$$$, its value is $$$1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the set $$$\\{1,3\\}$$$, its value is $$$2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the set $$$\\{2,3\\}$$$, its value is $$$2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" for the set $$$\\{1,2,3\\}$$$, its value is $$$2$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So, the sum of values over all $$$2^n$$$ sets of colors is $$$11$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1954D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1954/problem/D"}